    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><br>The game is a short walking simulator that explores a 3D space.<br>However, the controlling character is trapped in the Mirror World, and the player must control him from the real world to lead him to the goal.<br><br>The only obstacles in the way of walking are those that exist in the Mirror World. <br>Obstacles in the real world can be ignored. The player must successfully dodge invisible obstacles.<br><br>The controls are first-person, with only movement and the camera as the main controls.<br>No time limit or advanced action controls are required. Take your time and enjoy the exploration!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game system</h2>\u30fbMirror<br>When you look into the mirror, you can see the world beyond.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/e2b8e13c8928a1d398ffa52f25495e4c.poster.avif?t=1713263537\" width=682 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/e2b8e13c8928a1d398ffa52f25495e4c.webm?t=1713263537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/e2b8e13c8928a1d398ffa52f25495e4c.mp4?t=1713263537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u30fbButton<br>When you press the button, the mirror appears at the current position.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/0eb98224a9f2490034e92177073dbb62.poster.avif?t=1713263537\" width=682 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/0eb98224a9f2490034e92177073dbb62.webm?t=1713263537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/0eb98224a9f2490034e92177073dbb62.mp4?t=1713263537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u30fbGoal<br>Touch the goal to advance to the next stage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/797bc4ecbfb59c873c133656b57a10ad.poster.avif?t=1713263537\" width=682 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/797bc4ecbfb59c873c133656b57a10ad.webm?t=1713263537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870810/extras/797bc4ecbfb59c873c133656b57a10ad.mp4?t=1713263537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
